{"key":"df392d96d231aa47","source_file":"Potts St - Sy.json","source_id":38145,"source_url":"concordance-suffice-ppl-sufficere","term":"Suffice","headwords":["Suffice","Sufficiency"],"latin":["Sufficere","Sufficientia"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Suffice"],"latin":["Sufficere"]},{"english":["Sufficiency"],"latin":["Sufficientia"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AC","CL","DLord","DeVerbo"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"5663","subsection":"end"},"text":"It could no longer suffice that the Divine Itself should inflow through Heaven... HH 101:2.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DLord","section":"41","subsection":null},"text":"These few [quotations] may suffice. AE 326:end.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"250","subsection":"end"},"text":"According to (their capacity of being wise) a sufficiency of wealth is given them.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"293","subsection":"4"},"text":"On the sufficiency, etc. of this current of love, conjugial love depends.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"433","subsection":"2"},"text":"This spiritual sufficiency, even in the Natural, will not be wanting at this day to those who approach the Lord, and abominate adulteries as infernal.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DeVerbo","section":"6","subsection":null},"text":"They insisted that natural theology suffices.","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"suffice","url":"/meta/potts/suffice/"}